{"id":"d_main_42_03","cat":"main","group":{"id":"ch42","label":"Chapter 42 · Only One"},"label":"Recurrence","stage":"42-13 STAGE · Start","prev":"d_main_42_02","next":"d_main_42_04","speakers":{"mori":"Mori","liberalio":"Liberalio","rapi_red":"Rapi","cinderella":"Cinderella","littlemermaid":"Little Mermaid","ziz":"Ziz","behemoth":"Behemoth","leviathan":"Leviathan"},"icons":{"mori":"si_c590_00_s","liberalio":"si_c262_00_s","rapi_red":"si_c016_00_s","cinderella":"si_c511_00_s","littlemermaid":"si_c513_00_s","ziz":"si_c561_00_s","behemoth":"si_c560_00_s","leviathan":"si_c562_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"d_main_42_03_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_1","text":"I c-can't believe G-Gluttony is here...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhiteArk_1","bgArt":"whiteark_1","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_ubsphere_hunger_loop","movie":null,"shown":["liberalio","mori","rapi_red","cinderella","littlemermaid"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_2","text":"More will come. For Gluttony, the Four Beasts' Queen is the perfect prey.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_3","text":"We only barely managed to take it down last time...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_4","text":"You took it down?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"mori","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_5","text":"Err... Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_6","text":"Impressive.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_7","text":"It's hunting the Four Beasts. Let's save them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_8","text":"Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_9","text":"They're determined to be our enemy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_10","text":"They have no intention of talking.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_11","text":"My condition for cooperating was to kill the Four Beasts and their fake queen.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_12","text":"The moment you try to save them, the deal is off.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_13","text":"The reason you want the Four Beasts gone is because they tried to create a queen, isn't it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_14","text":"That's right. No queen other than Mother may exist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_15","text":"But another queen has already been created.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_16","text":"And they're definitely not on her side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_17","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_17","text":"If we want to increase our odds, we need to cooperate. You told me that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_18","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_19","text":"All we need to do is take down this new queen together, right? And that'll solve everything?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_20","text":"The Four Beasts were not created by Mother.\nThey shouldn't exist.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_21","text":"Because Mother would hate them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"cinderella","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_22","text":"What a dutiful daughter you are.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_23","text":"It took a long time to create this new queen.\nIf we work together to defeat it,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_24","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_24","text":"it'd take just as long or even longer to make another, if that's even possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_25","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_25","text":"That'll force the Four Beasts to go into hiding.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_26","text":"You and your queen won't need to pay them any mind.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_27","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_28","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_28","text":"They've already managed to make a queen. If we find out how they've done it, either through force or otherwise,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_29","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_29","text":"then we can prevent them from ever making another one.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_30","text":"I'm saying you should leave them be, and only use them when you need them.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_31","text":"A peaceful coexistence, like what you were talking about before.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_32","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_33","text":"The Four Beasts won't cooperate with you.\nThey won't talk.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_34","text":"They were born different.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_35","text":"They were made individually in such a way that they'll never be able to merge with others.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_36","text":"But what you said makes sense.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"liberalio","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_37","text":"You convinced me. I'll cooperate.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_38","text":"Thanks.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_39","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_39","text":"Also, Rapi.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_40","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_40","text":"I haven't given up on talking with them yet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapi_red","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_41","text":"... Roger that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_42","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_42","text":"Siren.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"littlemermaid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_43","text":"Ah woo?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_44","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_44","text":"You take care of Leviathan. Something happened between you two, didn't it?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"littlemermaid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_45","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"littlemermaid","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_46","text":"Yeah.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_47","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_47","text":"Good. Now, let's get going.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_48","text":"None of our attacks are working!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_42_01_1","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_42_01_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_49","text":"Agh! I'd heard stories about this thing, but I didn't think it'd be this insane!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_50","text":"W-what if we go inside its stomach... and do something? Lots of p-people do that, right?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_51","text":"Like who?! And there's no telling what's inside that thing's stomach! It's too dangerous!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_52","text":"Th-then what should we do? W-we need to save Bahamut!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_53","text":"At this rate, we're g-going to get eaten a-alive!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_54","text":"N-no matter how high I fly, it s-stretches and c-catches up...!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_55","text":"We've got to beat it somehow.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_56","text":"Levi! Any ideas?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_57","text":"*Huff... huff... huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_58","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_58","text":"Leviathan keeps charging straight ahead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_59","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_59","text":"Ziz and Behemoth yell from behind her, but she doesn't turn around.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ziz","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_60","text":"Levi!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_61","text":"*Huff... huff... huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"EventScene_Chap_42_01_2","bgArt":"eventscene_chap_42_01_2","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_62","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_62","text":"What do we do? I thought if we made a queen, she'd be on our side.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_63","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_63","text":"But she swallowed Bahamut, and tried to eat all of us.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_64","text":"*Huff... huff... huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_65","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_65","text":"Is Bahamut okay? If she went inside the Dark Matter, she should be alive, but if not she's probably dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_66","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_66","text":"What if Bahamut is dead? I never even gave her that book, or a pair of proper glasses.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_67","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_67","text":"I should've told her she's smart, even if I didn't mean it. All I ever did was tease her and call her stupid. I should have been nicer to her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_68","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_68","text":"No, no. She's not dead yet. No way. I'm sure she's still alive.\nBut there is a good chance she's dead.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_69","text":"*Huff... huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_70","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_70","text":"Why do they keep chasing us? They want to talk? About what?\nThey seem like good people... I mean, they are good people.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_71","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_71","text":"I'm scared, though. Not about being betrayed. That's a lie. I'm scared I'll betray them. They're good people. What would that make me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_72","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_72","text":"I betrayed Siren, so why wouldn't I betray them? If things get too dangerous, I'll run and leave them behind. That's how broken I am.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_73","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_73","text":"What kind of look would they give me? And what will they think of me? \nWill they think I'm a good person? Could I ever be a good person?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_74","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_74","text":"Please don't come after me. Don't talk to me. Just leave me alone. Please.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_75","text":"*Huff... huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_76","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_76","text":"Ugh, freakin' Gluttony. Damn you, Gluttony.\nI'm scared. I'm scared. I'm scared.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_77","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_77","text":"Gluttony devoured Siren, and I turned my back on her. Why didn't I fight for her? Why did I run away?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_78","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_78","text":"That's Siren. Why is Siren here? Is she real? She said she was.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_79","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_79","text":"She must resent me. I ran away when it mattered most. That grilled fish was so good. I had so much fun playing with those bubbles.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_80","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_80","text":"What should I say when I see Siren? \nWait, Siren's dead. It's pointless to think about. That's a fake. Or maybe she's real.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_81","text":"*Huff...!*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_82","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_82","text":"The Queen, Rapi, the failed cores, Bahamut's gift, died, rescued, survived, talked, betrayed, good people, Gluttony, Siren, grilled fish, bubbles, Dark Matter, Ziz, Behemoth, Whaley, Raptilion, the Offsprings, Liberalio...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"leviathan","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_83","text":"*Huff...*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_84","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_84","text":"Ugh, I can't do this.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"WhiteArk_1","bgArt":"whiteark_1","image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["leviathan","behemoth","ziz"],"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_85","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_85","text":"Leviathan suddenly stops.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"d_main_42_03_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"behemoth","key":"Locale_MainScenario:d_main_42_03_86","text":"Levi! Keep